reviewers._default:
This host uses two reviewer roles.

⓪ launches one `reviewer-gpt`: the shared understanding is what the main agent interviewed out itself, so the reviewer must be a different model.
{gpt_launch}

① launches one `reviewer-gpt` per perspective.
{gpt_launch}

② launches one `reviewer-claude` per perspective.
{claude_launch}

⑤ launches one `reviewer-gpt` and one `reviewer-claude` per perspective. Compare the two sets of findings for the same perspective side by side, then dispose as `/mmw-review` specifies.

Each reviewer receives only its own four-field task.
